{"id": "t131-001", "text": "Long catch-up with Esther over coffee. She and Noah are finally moving to Leeds, probably sometime in the spring once his contract ends. She's dreading the packing, they've got eight years of stuff in that loft. Noah's already flying up next Friday to look at a couple of flats near Headingley. Their son Kieran stays in London for uni. Remind me to send her that removals company I used.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "once his contract ends", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the packing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying up", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "look at a couple of flats near Headingley", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "stays in London for uni", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that removals company I used", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t131-007", "text": "Bumped into Freya at the station. She's off to Japan for three weeks in the new year, Tokyo then Kyoto. Her boyfriend Lior is going too, first big trip together. She's been learning Japanese on Duolingo for months and is weirdly good. Lior's never been further than Spain so she's a bit worried about him on a 14 hour flight. They leave on the 8th, a Thursday, early evening. Her mum's having their cat while they're away.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Freya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Japan", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning Japanese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit worried", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 8th, a Thursday, early evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t131-010", "text": "Quick one: Rahul's mum is having her knee op next Thursday. He's taking the whole week off to look after her. I'm doing the school run for his kids on Thursday and Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rahul", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the whole week off", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday and Friday"}]}
{"id": "t131-012", "text": "Ben got back from Peru last night! Machu Picchu trek done, says his knees are wrecked. Ask him for photos when I see him tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got back from Peru", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Machu Picchu trek", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him for photos", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see him tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t131-016", "text": "Jack's flight to Sydney got cancelled, so he's going Thursday at 6am instead. 23 hours with a layover in Singapore. He's nervous because it's his first time flying alone since the panic attacks. His sister Laila's meeting him at the other end. He'll be there till spring, staying with her and her husband in Bondi. Message him Wednesday night to wish him luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 6am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "23 hours", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "panic attacks", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Bondi", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Message him", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t131-017", "text": "Yusuf's going travelling for six months after he finishes uni in the summer. South America first, then maybe Asia. His parents aren't thrilled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "travelling", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "six months", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finishes uni", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "aren't thrilled", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t131-020", "text": "Sean Murphy's back from Cork. Said his gran's 90th was brilliant, the whole family came over. He's off again in a few weeks for his brother Chris's stag in Dublin.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean Murphy", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Cork", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "90th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a few weeks", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stag in Dublin", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t131-022", "text": "Abebe told me his sister Marisol got the place at Edinburgh, starts in September. Their family's moving up nearer to her at some stage next year. He's going to miss Brighton. His dad's already house hunting online every night. Abebe's staying behind for his final year, he'll move in with his girlfriend Salma. Ask him how the open day on Saturday goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the place at Edinburgh", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving up nearer to her", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "some stage next year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "going to miss Brighton", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "final year", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how the open day on Saturday goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e5", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "open day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e5"}]}
{"id": "t131-024", "text": "Gemma - dad's home from hospital, much better. Says thanks for the flowers. Kids going to their gran's for half term.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home from hospital", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "much better", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "half term"}]}
{"id": "t131-025", "text": "Coffee with Noah. He's been offered a job in Berlin, starts after Christmas, and he's still deciding whether to take it. Esther would go with him but she's only just settled at her new school. Ring him at the weekend to see what he decided.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a job in Berlin", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "settled at her new school", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ring him", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t131-026", "text": "Esther's cat Pickle went missing on Monday but turned up yesterday evening, filthy but fine. She was in bits.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday evening"}]}
{"id": "t131-030", "text": "Afua's mum is flying in from Accra on Saturday for a month. First time she's met the baby. Afua is excited but also stressing about the spare room not being ready.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Accra", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t131-032", "text": "Spoke to Rahul. His mum's op went fine, she's up and walking already. He's back at work Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rahul", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t131-035", "text": "Long call with Julia tonight. Got the flat! Moving in on the 1st, which is a Wednesday, so she's taking Thursday and Friday off too. Her brother Ben's lending his van. She's already planning a housewarming but probably not till after Christmas. Offer to help her paint that weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Got the flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Moving in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st, which is a Wednesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday and Friday"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "not till after Christmas", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Offer to help her paint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t131-037", "text": "Ivan and his wife are off to Croatia for their 20th anniversary sometime in June. He wants it to be a surprise for her so keep it quiet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Croatia", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "20th anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in June", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t131-040", "text": "Mustafa's dad passed away on Sunday. Funeral's in Istanbul, the family's flying out Thursday. Mustafa is doing ok-ish. Must send a card before they go and call him when he's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "ok-ish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before they go", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he's back", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t131-041", "text": "Laila's off to New York on Monday for a work conference, back Friday. Her husband Karim is on dad duty all week with the twins and he's dreading it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to New York", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "work conference", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dad duty", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t131-043", "text": "Catch up with Oliver and Salma. Oliver's moving to Glasgow in the new year for his PhD. Salma's staying put in Leeds for now, they'll do long distance. She seemed a bit flat about it, and her mum's not been well either, so it's a lot at once. Oliver's flying back for her birthday on the 22nd. Planning a weekend in Edinburgh together in February.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying put in Leeds", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "long distance", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit flat", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "not been well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "weekend in Edinburgh", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e5"}]}
{"id": "t131-044", "text": "Julien's started French classes again on Tuesday evenings. He wants to be fluent before they move to Lyon, which is 'some time next year, probably autumn'.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "French classes", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evenings"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to be fluent", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to Lyon", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "some time next year, probably autumn", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t131-046", "text": "Yusuf's sister Gemma got engaged on holiday in Santorini! Wedding not till 2028 probably. He's chuffed.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "not till 2028", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chuffed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t131-048", "text": "Sean's back from the stag, says Dublin nearly killed him. Wedding's in a fortnight, Saturday the 30th at 1pm. I've got the suit sorted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stag", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight, Saturday the 30th at 1pm", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t131-049", "text": "Phone call with Esther. Noah's taking the Berlin job! They're moving the second week of January. Esther's handing in her notice on Friday and is quite emotional about leaving her class. Their landlord here wants two months notice which is a pain. She asked if I'd keep an eye on their post for a while after they go. Should plan a send-off dinner before Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Berlin job", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the second week of January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "handing in her notice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite emotional", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a while after they go", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "plan a send-off dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "send-off dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Christmas", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t131-051", "text": "Anil's back from Delhi. Wedding was amazing apparently, three days of it. Jet lag is wrecking him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Delhi", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three days", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t131-053", "text": "Milan sent pics of the new flat in Rotterdam. Tiny but right by the canal. Biscuit hates the stairs.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat in Rotterdam", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Tiny but right by the canal", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t131-054", "text": "Grocery list: oat milk, eggs, bin bags. Return the parcel before Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "oat milk, eggs, bin bags", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Return the parcel", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Thursday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t131-060", "text": "Long day. Going to bed early, gym tomorrow at 7.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gym", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow at 7", "anchor": "e1"}]}
